# Every text file is LF, in the repository and in every checkout, whatever
# core.autocrlf says. The generators (cargo fmt, npm run gen, odin.nu gen,
# set-version.nu) write LF, so a Windows checkout converted to CRLF read
# every generated file as stale, and a test splitting a file it read on
# "\n" kept a "\r" on each line. Git tells binary files (the book's
# pictures) apart on its own; fuzz/.gitattributes marks the fuzz inputs.
* text=auto eol=lf
